{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】深水埗舊樓疑有角鐵墮下，擊傷女途人送院治理。</p>\n<p>現場是鴨寮街1至7號近白楊街，有警員在現場搜證。事發於下午約四時，一名女途人途經該大廈時被硬物擊中，她清醒送往明愛醫院治理。現場消息稱，懷疑該硬物是一件角鐵，警方正調查事故原因。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T11:40:04.038535+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T11:08:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T11:34:00.556910+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T11:34:00.556910+00:00","content_hash":"65651b3b18a0e5659ee02001bf7fb6f2381ac05b109aab5886dff421cb12e290","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}